Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.21,0:00:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the endless dream guides\Nyour restless spirit,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.81,0:00:20.31,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,59)\fscx120\fscy120\bord3.3}Timing
