Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think back to the time\Nwhen my search first began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.81,0:00:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I left behind those shores of sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.39,0:00:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the endless everlasting\Nworld out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.53,0:00:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that with the\Nburning passion driving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.91,0:00:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday, somewhere, I'll finally see the\Nlight I have searched for everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.11,0:00:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the summer sun is shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.85,0:00:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shaking the sails of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.17,0:01:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I know the way the long moon's sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.03,0:01:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A brand new world that I have been hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.91,0:01:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has opened up its doors for me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.89,0:01:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way the long moon's sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.03,0:01:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wearing in the troubled waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.45,0:01:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From all despair I can be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.97,0:01:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the horizon on the other side is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.69,0:01:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And though I travel far\Nfrom where my search began.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.71,0:01:31.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over seas of green and shores of sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.27,0:01:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the endless\Neverlasting world out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.43,0:01:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that with this\Nburning passion driving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.81,0:01:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some days somewhere I'll\Nfinally see the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.95,0:01:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will search for everywhere.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.78,0:01:54.70,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(725,1025)\bord1.7\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(684,725,\1a&H00&)\t(3854,3895,\1a&HFF&)}Let's Eat
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.78,0:01:54.70,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(725,1025)\c&HE7E6E5&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Let's Eat
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.31,0:01:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you want to tell us, old-timer?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.83,0:01:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up and listen good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.63,0:02:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've decided to tell you guys\Neverything I know about the Sky Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.01,0:02:05.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most of this is rumor and hearsay,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.11,0:02:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you'll have to make up your own\Nminds whether you believe it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.23,0:02:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe it. Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.35,0:02:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something very strange that\Nhappens in this part of the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.95,0:02:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything will suddenly\Nturn black as night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.33,0:02:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right in the middle of the brightest day!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.23,0:02:21.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, yeah, the same thing\Nhappened to us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.61,0:02:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was like the sun vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.61,0:02:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then these enormous\Nmonsters showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.97,0:02:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saw the giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.39,0:02:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a tale about where they come from.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.35,0:02:32.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But forget about them for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.63,0:02:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can go into it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.67,0:02:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now about this strange nightfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.87,0:02:42.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's caused by the shadow\Nof an extremely dense cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.41,0:02:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cumulonimbus clouds?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.53,0:02:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it was too dark for clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.37,0:02:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was like the sun went out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.57,0:02:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was more of an eclipse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.87,0:02:52.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clouds on a cloudy day\Nare just sort of cloudy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.27,0:02:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just sort of cloudy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.61,0:02:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, cloudy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.52,0:02:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your gums and listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.35,0:02:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This cloud is called a cumuloregalus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.01,0:03:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It forms high in the sky, it has no internal\Nair currents, and never turns to rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.99,0:03:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No light can reach the ground, and a\Nsunny afternoon turns black as pitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.49,0:03:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like some giant hand reached up and\Nsnuffed out the Sun like it was a candle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.13,0:03:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some say the cumuloregalus\Nclouds are floating fossils?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.23,0:03:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Petrified clouds that hang in the\Nsky unchanged for thousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.25,0:03:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding us—a petrified\Ncloud that drifts around for centuries. Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.75,0:03:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just telling you\Nwhat people have told me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.71,0:03:31.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whether you believe it or\Nnot Is entirely up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.79,0:03:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's a mystery cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.95,0:03:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess that sums it up\Nabout as well as anything else
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.67,0:03:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see there's only one\Nplace this sky island can be
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.79,0:03:45.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if it's real and that's on top\Nof one of those clouds. Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.39,0:03:52.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.01,0:04:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gonna be the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.92,0:04:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hard part because you'll
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.84,0:04:05.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be risking your lives every\Nminute you mean like now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.79,0:04:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one way to get\Nthere, the knock-up stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.09,0:04:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It shoots straight up in the air,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.83,0:04:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it could theoretically take\Nyou into the sky if you're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.07,0:04:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.98,0:04:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to say this current\Ncan actually send ships flying?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.85,0:04:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, then it'll be a snap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.09,0:04:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is hit to ride up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.91,0:04:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.09,0:04:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On an ocean current?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.79,0:04:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except wouldn't we wind\Nup falling back into
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.83,0:04:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the ocean and getting smashed into pieces?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.45,0:04:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usually, that's true, unless you\Ncan get the timing just right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.71,0:04:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's one thing to sit here all comfy and\Ntalk about riding the knock-up stream
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.63,0:04:41.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you think this trip is going\Nto be some kind of pleasure cruise,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.87,0:04:43.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're in for a very rude awakening
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.71,0:04:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The knock-up stream is as\Ndangerous as any hurricane
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.99,0:04:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should be avoided at all costs
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.25,0:04:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how exactly can a current of water\Nrise up in the air in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.27,0:05:01.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, we've never heard anything\Nlike that before, right guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.91,0:05:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard a lot of different\Nexplanations for the knock-up stream,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.31,0:05:09.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there's only been one\Nthat's made any sense to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.77,0:05:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though so far no one has been\Nstupid enough to try and confirm it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.65,0:05:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.87,0:05:22.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deep below the ocean floor, there\Nare large cavities filled with air.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.25,0:05:25.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool seawater seeps\Ninto these air pockets,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.89,0:05:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and geothermal energy heats\Nit until it becomes steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.47,0:05:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over time, the pressure builds,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.33,0:05:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when it finally becomes too\Ngreat, there's a tremendous explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.85,0:05:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This explosion hurls the water into the\Nair and creates a current to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.13,0:05:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The effect lasts for about one minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.79,0:05:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,connecting the ocean to the\Nsky like a bridge. One minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.51,0:05:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you realize how enormous an\Nexplosion like that would have to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.09,0:05:55.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The explosions occur in widely different\Nlocations about five times a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.41,0:05:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd be blown into fish food\Nif we tried that old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.11,0:06:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you can't really explain something\Nlike this with words and theories.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.57,0:06:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's one of the great\Nmysteries of creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.75,0:06:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, so then,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.05,0:06:09.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we gotta ride this current\Nthat shows up five times
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.25,0:06:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a month into the air to\Nreach some island in the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.65,0:06:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just hope it's waiting for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.15,0:06:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd say that sums it up pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.61,0:06:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you miss, you fall back down,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.23,0:06:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,slam into the ocean, and\Nget blown into fish food.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.73,0:06:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.33,0:06:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so we're going to forget\Nabout Sky Island, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.99,0:06:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because it's nuts, Loopy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.29,0:06:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's completely insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.37,0:06:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to be luckier than Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.65,0:06:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky McLuckluck of Lucky Land on its\Nlucky day to pull off a set like this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.95,0:06:44.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be okay. Let's go. Naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.97,0:06:46.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you say it'll be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.53,0:06:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about it for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.93,0:06:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what about the poor Going Merry?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.89,0:06:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you even stop to\Nconsider the shape she's in?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.21,0:06:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way she's suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.91,0:06:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way you could\Nexpect her to stand
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.21,0:06:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up to a disaster like\Nthis in her condition!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.25,0:07:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's absolutely right. She's worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.33,0:07:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even brand new, that wreck\Nwouldn't stand a chance. Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.51,0:07:06.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speed, weight, strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.31,0:07:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The explosion would blow that ship to pieces\Nbefore it had a chance to get airborne!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.13,0:07:14.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, see, it's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.73,0:07:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't worry, I think\NI can help you out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.31,0:07:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have Mashida and Shoujo do\Na complete refit of your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.51,0:07:23.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll also have them reinforce the\Nsuperstructure to withstand the strain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.03,0:07:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.94,0:07:26.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, guys, we're all over it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.91,0:07:27.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, fellas!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.33,0:07:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.83,0:07:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you really thought about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.61,0:07:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.52,0:07:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, about...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.44,0:07:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, how about the fact that at most,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.17,0:07:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we can only stay one more day on this\Nisland, or did that slip your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.81,0:07:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.72,0:07:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Log Pose will lock on to the next\Nisland's location and we'll have to move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.75,0:07:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right! That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.63,0:07:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta move on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.63,0:07:49.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.99,0:07:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I realize you're not a fortune teller and\Nyou probably don't have the vaguest idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.55,0:07:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how many days will it\Nbe until the next time the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.55,0:07:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,knock-up stream lines up\Nwith the cumulary gallus?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.55,0:07:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or better yet, how many weeks?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.71,0:07:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or months?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.62,0:08:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or years?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or centuries?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.45,0:08:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.36,0:08:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in no hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.28,0:08:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I lend you an abacus?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.19,0:08:06.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be at around noon tomorrow,\Nso you better get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.01,0:08:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.92,0:08:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean we can make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.99,0:08:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Afraid so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.90,0:08:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're scared, then don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.15,0:08:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.99,0:08:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something fishy about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.77,0:08:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've known you less than 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.69,0:08:21.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you being so helpful?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.43,0:08:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's more...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.73,0:08:23.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now hold on, Uso.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.97,0:08:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, you hold up till I'm finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.83,0:08:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This Sky Island, this legendary place\Nwe don't even know the location of,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.91,0:08:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is just gonna show up out of\Nthe blue at noon tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.53,0:08:37.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to help us get there, you're\Ngonna rebuild and reinforce our ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.13,0:08:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.35,0:08:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When something looks too good\Nto be true, it probably is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.53,0:08:44.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The infamous liar Nolan is your\Ngreat-great-grand whatever, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.87,0:08:47.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how do we know we can trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.75,0:08:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, old man! Soup's on! Come and get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.17,0:08:54.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.83,0:08:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.23,0:09:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.71,0:09:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to fight me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.69,0:09:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mashida said, Whenever midday\Nnight occurs in this area,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.73,0:09:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a cumula regalis cloud appears\Nin the southern sky the next day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.45,0:09:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Based on its usual cycle of\Nfive appearances a month,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.53,0:09:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing the knock-up stream\Nwill also erupt tomorrow at midday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.41,0:09:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That will probably also be to the south.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.85,0:09:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't be 100 % certain, but there's a\Ngood chance the two events will coincide.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.93,0:09:36.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm proud to have met a bunch\Nof brave fools like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.35,0:09:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're true pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.91,0:09:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, let's go inside and eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.71,0:09:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tonight I want you to\Ncall my home your home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.53,0:09:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.81,0:09:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Usopp, it's chow time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.85,0:09:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, come on, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.81,0:09:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, go get Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.99,0:10:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like we're going to this Sky\NIsland, whether we're ready or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.57,0:10:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's just hope our\Nluck continues to hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.05,0:10:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, do you think I'm a\Nspineless little coward?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.43,0:10:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You forgot to mention idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.21,0:10:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.09,0:10:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now why not go apologize?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.35,0:10:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, old-timer. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.43,0:10:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't wipe that nose on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.25,0:10:21.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's disgusting! Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.63,0:10:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come over here, buddy, and get in with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.75,0:10:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, keep it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.53,0:10:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That really hits the old spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.01,0:10:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eat up, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.92,0:10:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.27,0:10:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's plenty more on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.31,0:10:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotcha, face! Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.37,0:10:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was hot sauce!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.65,0:10:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come here, you squirrely\Ngodly little face!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.21,0:10:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, good-looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.33,0:10:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want to sit next to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.41,0:10:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, shift down the gear, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.85,0:10:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're about a hundred years\Ntoo old to be hitting on Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.05,0:10:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The skull's right eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.49,0:11:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where I saw the gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.25,0:11:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those words smeared with tears are the\Nlast ones Nolan wrote in his logbook.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.07,0:11:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The skull's right eye,\Nthat's where I saw the gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.03,0:11:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That very same day, Noland was executed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.49,0:11:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still don't know what he meant by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.73,0:11:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does it refer to the\Nname of a city or some
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.55,0:11:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,landmark that used to exist on the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.09,0:11:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or is it just a poetic allusion\Nto his own impending death?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.77,0:11:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blank pages that\Nfollow give us no clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.29,0:11:38.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's the reason we continue\Nto dive to the bottom of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.57,0:11:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.17,0:11:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hooray for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.83,0:11:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.77,0:11:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not if you keep eating\Nlike that, we won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.23,0:11:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's getting pretty dark, but I\Ncan still make out the shoreline.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.67,0:11:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.58,0:12:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drop anchor and prepare to land!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.89,0:12:06.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Golden treasure shouldn't be\Nwasted on starry-eyed dreamers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.53,0:12:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Log Entry for May City, 1122.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.65,0:12:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today I Arrived on Jaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.99,0:12:16.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shortly after making landfall,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.07,0:12:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we were startled by the peculiar cries of
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.03,0:12:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some strange bird from\Ndeep in the forest!.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.05,0:12:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As well as the tolling of what\Nseemed to be an enormous bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.21,0:12:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ringing of that golden\Nbell resounded far and wide!.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.11,0:12:32.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As if announcing the presence of some\Ngreat and prosperous city of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.39,0:12:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its fleeting echoes the\Nonly reminder that this
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.23,0:12:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,land was once home to\Na mighty civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.37,0:12:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No land, no land?.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.57,0:12:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In our pride and arrogance,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.95,0:12:47.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we thought we had seen and heard\Neverything in our short lives!.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.63,0:12:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the sound of that bell\Ntolling left us all speechless!.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.65,0:12:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was as if the clang of that bell\Nhad struck us all dumb with wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.11,0:13:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just love stories with bells.?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.29,0:13:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and them specially gold ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.79,0:13:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, old-timer, it sounds like you just\Nmight be a little fond of Nolan after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.47,0:13:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.57,0:13:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, a golden bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.31,0:13:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, doesn't seem too enormous to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.29,0:13:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of these is the one Nolan\Nwas writing about in his log book.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.71,0:13:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are bell-shaped golden ingots we\Nfound on the ocean floor during a dive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.43,0:13:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Golden ingot?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.34,0:13:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The city of gold! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.73,0:13:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.83,0:13:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still not proof, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.01,0:13:31.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could find golden\Nrelics like that lying
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.23,0:13:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,around in any old ruin in\Nthis part of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.51,0:13:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe so, but it does suggest there was\Na civilization here sometime in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.99,0:13:41.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ingots are made to divide gold\Ninto standardized units of weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.35,0:13:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that would indicate an\Nadvanced trading society.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.27,0:13:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.18,0:13:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you remember that peculiar bird call\Nhe said they heard when they landed?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.09,0:13:49.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show it to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.51,0:13:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's more gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.63,0:13:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at the size of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.35,0:13:55.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the last of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.57,0:13:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's gorgeous!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.35,0:13:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Golden bells and birds, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.49,0:14:03.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think they might be symbols\Nof some ancient giant civilization?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.37,0:14:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really couldn't say for certain,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.17,0:14:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm pretty sure all these pieces\Nwere part of the same casting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.17,0:14:10.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This creature is called a Southbird.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.35,0:14:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can still find them\Non this island today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.79,0:14:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, and they have a peculiar call?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.07,0:14:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, just like in the logbook.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.93,0:14:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sailors have used Southbirds on ships\Nsince ancient times to help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.81,0:14:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.47,0:14:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.75,0:14:27.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.89,0:14:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys got to get to the forest on\Nthe south side of the island right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.97,0:14:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.88,0:14:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.80,0:14:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.71,0:14:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't waste a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.62,0:14:36.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got to capture one of\Nthese birds and quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.65,0:14:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.93,0:14:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we need the bird for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.51,0:14:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.19,0:14:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow you're going to\Nsail for the knock-up stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.35,0:14:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It lies directly south of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.15,0:14:46.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you going to get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.27,0:14:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just sail the ship\Ndue south, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.07,0:14:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten this is the Grand Line?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.05,0:14:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're heading for open sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.39,0:14:57.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't be able to get your bearings?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.11,0:14:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.69,0:15:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without a landmass to lock onto,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.55,0:15:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Log Pose will be useless and\Nthere'll be no way for us to navigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.49,0:15:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's got to be some way we can\Nfigure out which direction to sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.97,0:15:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is, if you can lay your\Nhands on one of these birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.75,0:15:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Certain animals are known to\Nhave a very accurate internal
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.33,0:15:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sense of direction as if they're\Nborn with a natural compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.19,0:15:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes Zoro dumber than an animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.61,0:15:20.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.01,0:15:22.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like you have any room to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.11,0:15:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.02,0:15:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The South Bird is a perfect\Nexample of this kind of creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.53,0:15:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the middle of a vast, barren\Nplain or a trackless ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.87,0:15:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,its body will always point\Nin the same direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.41,0:15:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.32,0:15:40.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't get going to that forest\Nand catch one of those birds right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.47,0:15:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll have to kiss your only\Nchance to get to Sky Island goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.93,0:15:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're just telling us this now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.75,0:15:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit your whining!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.57,0:15:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time for that now. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.83,0:15:52.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it or lose it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.77,0:15:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You expect us to go stumbling through\Nthe forest in the middle of the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.71,0:15:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget these.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.55,0:16:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The three of us are gonna get started\Non the repairs to your broken-down ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.47,0:16:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, now that I think about it, we\Nprobably shouldn't have had that party.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.79,0:16:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.70,0:16:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you tell us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.91,0:16:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, the clock's ticking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.59,0:16:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have until morning to catch a south
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.07,0:16:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bird or you can forget\Nabout the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.17,0:16:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's pitch black.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.79,0:16:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you let go of me, you idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.47,0:16:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stomach's still so\Nstuffed from that dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.07,0:16:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't catch a bird if I saw one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.49,0:16:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.97,0:16:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just catch one of them\Nand get back to drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.71,0:16:35.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will someone remind me how\Nwe ended up in this mess?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.55,0:16:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nanny couldn't tell us in the daylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.09,0:16:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It had to be in the middle of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.33,0:16:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are the birds?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.47,0:16:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had any idea where the birds were,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.31,0:16:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you think we'd be out\Nhere looking for them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.97,0:16:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we know is this thing's\Ngot a peculiar call.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.65,0:16:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and it looks just like\Nthat gold statue he showed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.43,0:16:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kind of hard for\Nme to believe that any
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.01,0:16:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bird could look that\Nscrewy-looking in real life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.13,0:16:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, saying it has a\Npeculiar call is too vague.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.93,0:16:58.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't ID it from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.33,0:17:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the old coot didn't seem to think\Nwe'd have any trouble finding one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.51,0:17:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.42,0:17:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounded peculiar!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.99,0:17:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you think? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.91,0:17:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.09,0:17:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do it and get it over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.39,0:17:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three nets, three teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.73,0:17:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's split up and bag that bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.85,0:17:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.76,0:17:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.68,0:17:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna beat up a bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.11,0:17:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're trying to catch it!
Dialogue: 2,0:17:24.79,0:17:30.17,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(524,0)\bord1\blur15\1a&HFF&\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs80\pos(720,600)}{Nami - Sanji - Usopp - OG}Team 1\NSanji - Usopp - Nami{PP+PJ}
Dialogue: 3,0:17:24.79,0:17:30.17,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(524,0)\shad0\bord0\blur0.6\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs80\pos(720,600)}{Nami - Sanji - Usopp - OG}Team 1\NSanji - Usopp - Nami{PP+PJ}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.35,0:17:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.89,0:17:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what we run into,\NI'm here to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.45,0:17:31.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too, Sanji Lump.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.85,0:17:34.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you suck it up and\Nstop being such a wuss?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.33,0:17:36.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys, let's catch that bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.21,0:17:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.17,0:17:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's all settle down and see\Nif we can hear that bird's call again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.07,0:17:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, there it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.13,0:17:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on out! Moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.97,0:17:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, why are you catching me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.15,0:17:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, nice accessorizing there, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.49,0:17:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd you get that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.73,0:17:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.81,0:18:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spider!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.73,0:18:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.64,0:18:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.67,0:18:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come here, you poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.39,0:18:08.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate spiders, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.43,0:18:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Throw that thing away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.95,0:18:11.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get rid of it, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.51,0:18:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's probably poisonous!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.51,0:18:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're falling from the trees!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.23,0:18:16.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just too nasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.61,0:18:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you're a species of tarantula.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.89,0:18:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.47,0:18:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't bite you unless you\Nmake them angry or frighten them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.85,0:18:26.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used to wrestle with spiders\Nlike this all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.25,0:18:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your tiny little mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.67,0:18:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hairy bugs like that\Ncompletely freak me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.31,0:18:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.22,0:18:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They make my flesh crawl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.43,0:18:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Throw it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.34,0:18:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stand it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.26,0:18:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.17,0:18:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you don't seem to\Nhave any problem with
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.87,0:18:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the centipedes and moths\Non the tree behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.49,0:18:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.40,0:18:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me here alone!
Dialogue: 2,0:18:54.13,0:18:57.26,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(482,0)\bord1\blur20\1a&HFF&\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs80\pos(720,600)}{Robin - Zoro-OG}Team 2\NZoro - Robin{PP+PJ}
Dialogue: 3,0:18:54.13,0:18:57.26,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(482,0)\shad0\bord0\blur0.6\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs80\pos(720,600)}{Robin - Zoro-OG}Team 2\NZoro - Robin{PP+PJ}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.27,0:18:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.18,0:18:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounded like someone screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.69,0:18:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.27,0:19:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A centipede.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.47,0:19:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.21,0:19:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to kill\Nevery living thing we meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.67,0:19:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kind of rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.13,0:19:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, he shouldn't\Nhave snuck up on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.27,0:19:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait. Now what? You're\Ngoing back the way we came.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.25,0:19:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is again, come on and be\Ncareful not to step in the quicksand
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.97,0:19:28.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait for
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.37,0:19:34.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.61,0:19:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an Atlas!
Dialogue: 2,0:19:35.72,0:19:40.30,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(475,476)\bord1\blur15\1a&HFF&\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs80\pos(720,570)}{Luffy - Chopper - OG}Team 3\NLuffy - Chopper{PJ}
Dialogue: 3,0:19:35.72,0:19:40.30,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(475,476)\shad0\bord0\blur0.6\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs80\pos(720,570)}{Luffy - Chopper - OG}Team 3\NLuffy - Chopper{PJ}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.31,0:19:38.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Atlas? That's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.85,0:19:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this one and the Hercules\Nbeetle are some of the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.73,0:19:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,most prized insects in\Nthe world for collectors.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.37,0:19:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean there are people\Nwho collect insects?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.53,0:19:48.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, and these guys are\Nsome of the hardest to catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.17,0:19:51.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, which one is cooler,\Nthat bug or the One Piece?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.61,0:19:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a tough one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.17,0:19:55.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, there's one over here too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.47,0:19:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, meow, my stab beetle! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.93,0:19:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta catch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.33,0:20:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He flew away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.61,0:20:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.57,0:20:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.01,0:20:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A beehive! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.81,0:20:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck is wrong with this forage?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.79,0:20:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, look up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.71,0:20:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.62,0:20:32.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the one who dropped the beehives!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.27,0:20:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.19,0:20:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.10,0:20:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you understand him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.33,0:20:41.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said, I'll kill anyone\Nwho disturbs this forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.49,0:20:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now now little boy you don't really\Nwant to go and make us angry do you it's
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.83,0:21:01.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not nice to show up in the middle of\Nthe night and demand gold from someone
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.41,0:21:05.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now get lost we've got a lot of work\Nto do and not a lot of time to do it
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.03,0:21:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you must be the bodyguards and the\Nold man must be the ex-pirate cricket.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.11,0:21:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard the sad story of the\NMontblanc family back at the tavern.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.83,0:21:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It moved me to tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.89,0:21:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But stealing another man's\Ntreasure moves me even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.33,0:21:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.73,0:21:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cricket!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.64,0:21:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you'd like to know what people call\Nme before I take your whole life's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.15,0:21:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hyena!

